WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.062
This dossier examines the Phoenix Pay System architecture of failure.

00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:18.737
What began as a 309 million dollar payroll upgrade became a 2.2 billion dollar catastrophe, leaving over 150,000 federal workers in financial distress while executives ignored repeated warnings.
